{"title": "grep 子串陷阱与行尾锚定对照", "lines": [
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "netstat -nlp | grep :80 | awk '{print $4}'"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "0.0.0.0:8000"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "0.0.0.0:80"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "grep 子串匹配把 8000 一并命中，PID 取到谁看行序"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "netstat -nlp | awk '$4 ~ /:80$/'"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "tcp        0      0 0.0.0.0:80              0.0.0.0:*"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "               LISTEN      195/python3"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "行尾锚定后只剩 80 一行，PID 195 精确命中（折行展示）"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：Rocky Linux 9.3 容器（80/8000 双进程对照）"}
]}
